tle game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T03:40:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football betting: Should you still bet on Indiana to make the CFP?","description":"The Hoosiers dropped to No. 14 in the latest CPF rankings, but are they still a good bet to make the playoff?","published":"2026-11-25T04:16:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50588403/2026-college-football-playoff-cfp-indiana-hoosiers","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 Anger Index: Indiana dropped how many spots?!","description":"Ranking the teams that should be most upset with the latest CFP rankings.","published":"2026-11-25T03:26:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50582371/cfp-ranking-2026-anger-index-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the College Football Playoff bubble after committee's fourth ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-25T03:24:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Why UTEP-NIU is 2026's most unglamorous Game of the Century","description":"The Week 13 game will mark the first time since at least 2000 that two teams that are winless against FBS opponents will meet in their final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T01:19:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50587546/utep-niu-college-football-game-century","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Indiana falls from 12-team field in 4th CFP rankings; Horns, Vols leap Bama","description":"Defending champ Indiana fell six spots to No. 14, while Alabama was leaped by Texas and Tennessee and fell out of the top five in the latest CFP rankings Tuesday night.","published":"2026-11-25T07:42:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588082/indiana-top-12-cfp-rankings-texas-tennessee-leap-alabama","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the move? CFP committee's fourth top 25 and bracket of 2026","description":"A look at the new bracket based on the College Football Playoff committee's fourth set of rankings.","published":"2026-11-25T02:02:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584328/cfp-2026-fourth-committee-top-25-bracket","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"LSU asks judge to throw out SEC's 'unwarranted' suit against Tigers","description":"LSU is asking a federal judge to dismiss the SEC's lawsuit against the Tigers, arguing that many of the plaintiffs in the case are protected by sovereign immunity as state officials and that the league doesn't have jurisdiction.","published":"2026-11-25T05:10:29.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588015/lsu-asks-judge-throw-sec-unwarranted-suit-tigers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Stanford quarterback Davis Warren returning in 2027","description":"Davis Warren has agreed to return to the Cardinal for his final year of eligibility, sources said.","published":"2026-11-25T01:32:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588012/stanford-quarterback-davis-warren-returning-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wyoming's Jay Sawvel gets self-imposed 1-game ban over tampering violations","description":"Wyoming coach Jay Sawvel will serve a one-game suspension Saturday as part of the school's self-imposed penalties for impermissible contacting of players.","published":"2026-11-25T00:01:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50586972/wyoming-coach-jay-sawvel-gets-self-imposed-1-game-suspension","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079337/eli-bowen","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eli_Bowen_(American_football)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Eli Bowen (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eli_Bowen_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Eli Bowen (born October 15, 2005) is an American college football defensive back for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bowen attended John H. Guyer High School in Denton, Texas. As a sophomore, he recorded 46 tackles and ten interceptions. As a senior, he totaled 34 tackles, two tackles-for-loss, and three interceptions. A four-star recruit, Bowen committed to play college football at the University of Oklahoma over an offer from Texas."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman in 2024, Bowen received significant playing time, making an immediate impact. In his first career start against Texas, he led the team in tackles with eight. Against Alabama, Bowen recorded his first career interception at the collegiate level."}],"family":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Peyton Bowen","description":"American football cornerback","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peyton_Bowen"}]}}